+ * bootloader left in it. Upstream defines this in irq-xtensa-mx.c, which
+ * this platform does not build -- it is the MX driver's job there because
+ * the MX distributor owns the external interrupt mask. Here the mask is the
+ * core's own, so the core sets it itself.
